+			# Use GStreamer pipeline through PipeWire for cameras without V4L2 RGB output.
+			#
+			# pipewire_target: PipeWire node.name to capture from. Without it
+			# pipewiresrc grabs the DEFAULT source, which is the RGB camera --
+			# so the IR sensor must be named explicitly. Find it with:
+			#     pw-cli ls Node | grep -B2 'media.class = "Video/Source"'
+			# The HM1092 IR sensor is libcamera_input.__SB_.LNK0 on this machine.
+			#
+			# pipewire_flip: videoflip method, or "none". The RGB camera needs
